{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared fixture for the two implementations of claim stringification:",
    "router/claimrule.go's stringify (Go, the gateway) and",
    "webui/src/lib/claimMatch.ts's stringifyClaim (TypeScript, the Request",
    "path simulator). Both test suites read this file, so the twins cannot",
    "drift apart again without a test failing on one side or the other.",
    "",
    "Go renders a JSON number with fmt.Sprint on a float64, i.e. %v -> %g ->",
    "strconv.FormatFloat(x,'g',-1,64), which switches to scientific notation",
    "when the decimal exponent is < -4 or >= 6. JavaScript's String() only",
    "switches at 1e21, which is where the two used to disagree."
  ],
  "cases": [
    { "name": "small integer", "value": 42, "want": "42" },
    { "name": "zero", "value": 0, "want": "0" },
    { "name": "negative integer", "value": -7, "want": "-7" },
    { "name": "last fixed-notation integer", "value": 999999, "want": "999999" },
    { "name": "first scientific-notation integer", "value": 1000000, "want": "1e+06" },
    { "name": "tenant id in the divergence band", "value": 1000042, "want": "1.000042e+06" },
    { "name": "unix timestamp", "value": 1788392000, "want": "1.788392e+09" },
    { "name": "ten digits", "value": 1234567890, "want": "1.23456789e+09" },
    { "name": "negative in the band", "value": -1000000, "want": "-1e+06" },
    { "name": "three-digit exponent", "value": 1e123, "want": "1e+123" },
    { "name": "fraction", "value": 1.5, "want": "1.5" },
    { "name": "repeating fraction", "value": 0.1, "want": "0.1" },
    { "name": "smallest fixed-notation fraction", "value": 0.0001, "want": "0.0001" },
    { "name": "first scientific-notation fraction", "value": 0.00001, "want": "1e-05" },
    { "name": "float artefact", "value": 0.30000000000000004, "want": "0.30000000000000004" },
    { "name": "string passes through", "value": "db-writer", "want": "db-writer" },
    { "name": "empty string", "value": "", "want": "" },
    { "name": "null renders empty", "value": null, "want": "" },
    { "name": "true", "value": true, "want": "true" },
    { "name": "false", "value": false, "want": "false" }
  ]
}
